Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.66,0:00:05.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,give God the worry you cannot fix.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pray this with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:08.68,0:00:10.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight we will pray through
Dialogue: 4,0:00:10.62,0:00:12.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,the message you are waiting on,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:12.77,0:00:14.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,the work you carried home,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.57,0:00:15.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,the bills,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:15.27,0:00:17.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the people you love.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:17.23,0:00:18.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then Scripture will
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.60,0:00:20.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,carry you toward sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:21.36,0:00:23.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have checked the same
Dialogue: 4,0:00:23.48,0:00:25.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,message several times,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.09,0:00:26.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,hoping a reply would
Dialogue: 4,0:00:26.55,0:00:28.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,change how you feel.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.32,0:00:30.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can put the phone within
Dialogue: 4,0:00:30.44,0:00:32.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,reach but turn its face away.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:32.95,0:00:35.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the place where you are sitting
Dialogue: 4,0:00:35.35,0:00:37.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,or lying support your weight.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.64,0:00:40.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can arrive with a busy mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:40.63,0:00:41.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,In this prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:41.70,0:00:44.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,you will name your concerns separately,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:44.49,0:00:46.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,so you do not have to wrestle
Dialogue: 4,0:00:46.56,0:00:49.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,with every uncertainty at once.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:50.28,0:00:53.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Casting all your care upon him;
Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.16,0:00:55.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for he careth for you.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.03,0:00:57.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.57,0:00:59.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,I begin with the concern
Dialogue: 4,0:00:59.42,0:01:01.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,closest to the surface.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.49,0:01:02.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,I give it a plain
Dialogue: 4,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,name before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.42,0:01:07.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,It may be an unanswered message,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:07.01,0:01:08.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,a decision at work,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:08.55,0:01:12.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,or someone whose voice sounded troubled.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:12.10,0:01:13.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have carried it through
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.95,0:01:16.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,dinner and into this room.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.17,0:01:19.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now I bring it into our conversation.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:19.69,0:01:21.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me entrust this
Dialogue: 4,0:01:21.17,0:01:22.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,particular care to you,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.86,0:01:25.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,even before my feelings catch
Dialogue: 4,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,up with the words I am praying.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:28.79,0:01:29.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:29.20,0:01:30.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the answer
Dialogue: 4,0:01:30.68,0:01:32.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot make arrive.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.72,0:01:34.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have imagined reasons
Dialogue: 4,0:01:34.45,0:01:36.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the silence and measured
Dialogue: 4,0:01:36.56,0:01:39.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,the hours since I last checked.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:39.20,0:01:41.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me stop treating a missing
Dialogue: 4,0:01:41.58,0:01:44.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,reply as a verdict about my worth.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:44.49,0:01:46.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,If there is a sensible
Dialogue: 4,0:01:46.21,0:01:47.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,time to follow up,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:47.61,0:01:50.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me choose it in daylight.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,For this evening,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:51.48,0:01:53.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive both my hope
Dialogue: 4,0:01:53.03,0:01:55.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my disappointment.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:55.04,0:01:57.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold the uncertainty I cannot
Dialogue: 4,0:01:57.29,0:01:59.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,settle by checking again.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.74,0:02:01.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:01.27,0:02:03.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me make one kind boundary
Dialogue: 4,0:02:03.57,0:02:06.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the stream of information.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.24,0:02:08.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let necessary messages remain
Dialogue: 4,0:02:08.80,0:02:11.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,available without making every
Dialogue: 4,0:02:11.44,0:02:14.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,notification my responsibility.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:14.48,0:02:17.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for wisdom about the difference
Dialogue: 4,0:02:17.38,0:02:19.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,between being reachable
Dialogue: 4,0:02:19.19,0:02:21.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,and being constantly on watch.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:21.84,0:02:25.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,If no urgent duty requires my attention,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.18,0:02:28.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me let the phone grow quiet.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.24,0:02:29.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,I give you the impulse
Dialogue: 4,0:02:29.75,0:02:31.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,to search for one more update,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:31.81,0:02:33.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the fear that stopping
Dialogue: 4,0:02:33.59,0:02:35.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,means I have stopped caring.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:37.02,0:02:39.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be careful for nothing;
Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}but in every thing by prayer
Dialogue: 5,0:02:41.30,0:02:44.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and supplication with thanksgiving let
Dialogue: 5,0:02:44.05,0:02:47.07,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}your requests be made known unto God.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:48.52,0:02:48.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:48.91,0:02:50.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,we set down the work
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.44,0:02:52.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,that followed you home.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:53.09,0:02:53.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:53.47,0:02:55.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the work concern
Dialogue: 4,0:02:55.20,0:02:57.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,that followed me home.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:57.15,0:02:59.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is something I sent,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,something I missed,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.73,0:03:02.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,or something I may
Dialogue: 4,0:03:02.17,0:03:04.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,be asked to explain.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:04.06,0:03:06.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me separate the actual
Dialogue: 4,0:03:06.07,0:03:08.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,facts from the harsh story
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.00,0:03:10.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am telling about myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.23,0:03:11.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I made an error,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:11.60,0:03:14.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me the honesty to acknowledge
Dialogue: 4,0:03:14.06,0:03:16.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,it and the patience to correct it.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.82,0:03:19.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight I hand over the imagined
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,meeting that keeps starting
Dialogue: 4,0:03:21.64,0:03:23.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,again inside my head.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:24.85,0:03:25.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.38,0:03:27.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,make the next useful step
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.27,0:03:29.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,clear enough to recognize.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:29.54,0:03:32.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I need to check a number,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:32.16,0:03:33.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask a question,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.35,0:03:35.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,or explain a delay.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.16,0:03:37.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not need to rehearse every
Dialogue: 4,0:03:37.74,0:03:40.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,response another person might give.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.96,0:03:43.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me prepare what is mine
Dialogue: 4,0:03:43.11,0:03:45.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,to prepare and leave their
Dialogue: 4,0:03:45.10,0:03:47.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,reaction outside my control.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:47.55,0:03:50.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive my desire to do good work.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:50.95,0:03:52.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let that desire become
Dialogue: 4,0:03:52.57,0:03:54.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,steady attention tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,rather than another hour
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.27,0:03:58.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,of self-punishment tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.76,0:04:00.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:00.08,0:04:03.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember a moment today when someone
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.05,0:04:05.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,made a difficult thing easier.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.70,0:04:08.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they answered patiently,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:08.23,0:04:09.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,held a door,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.18,0:04:12.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,or let me start a sentence again.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.10,0:04:15.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that ordinary generosity.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.66,0:04:17.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the ability
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.43,0:04:19.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,to ask for help and for people
Dialogue: 4,0:04:19.56,0:04:21.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,who have helped before.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:21.49,0:04:23.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring this memory alongside
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.85,0:04:25.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,the unfinished work.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,My day contained more than
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.74,0:04:30.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,the moment I keep regretting;
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.24,0:04:31.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me remember it
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.73,0:04:33.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,with greater honesty.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:34.87,0:04:36.46,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And the peace of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which passeth all understanding,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:38.87,0:04:40.53,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall keep your hearts
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.53,0:04:43.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and minds through Christ Jesus.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:44.67,0:04:47.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stay with me a little longer.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.23,0:04:49.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now we bring the money worry
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.50,0:04:52.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,that grows louder after dark.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.74,0:04:53.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.28,0:04:55.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the household expense
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,that has been pressing on me.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.99,0:05:00.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the bill, the estimate,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,or the balance I need to review.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.98,0:05:04.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me clear judgment
Dialogue: 4,0:05:04.57,0:05:06.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I look at the facts.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:06.68,0:05:08.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me ask about arrangements
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.83,0:05:10.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I need them,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,and speak honestly with anyone
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.21,0:05:14.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,who shares this responsibility.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.74,0:05:17.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place these practical concerns
Dialogue: 4,0:05:17.13,0:05:20.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,before you without inventing a certainty
Dialogue: 4,0:05:20.12,0:05:22.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,about how they will turn out.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:22.59,0:05:25.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide my next responsible choice.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:27.00,0:05:27.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:27.39,0:05:29.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the midnight
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.12,0:05:31.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,calculations that repeat without
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.64,0:05:33.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,giving me new information.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:33.99,0:05:34.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:34.73,0:05:37.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me set aside a definite
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.01,0:05:38.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,time to look carefully,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.89,0:05:41.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,with paper, accurate figures,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.25,0:05:44.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and whatever advice is needed.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.00,0:05:46.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep shame from isolating me.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:46.94,0:05:48.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let courage take the form
Dialogue: 4,0:05:48.89,0:05:49.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,of a call made
Dialogue: 4,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a question asked.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.83,0:05:54.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight I give you my fear
Dialogue: 4,0:05:54.04,0:05:55.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,of falling behind,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.58,0:05:58.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ask for companionship and wisdom
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.64,0:06:01.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,as I address what is real.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can pause before
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.92,0:06:05.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,naming anything else.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.86,0:06:07.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Feel where your hands
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.33,0:06:08.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,have come to rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:08.89,0:06:10.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to move them
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.96,0:06:13.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a special position.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:13.03,0:06:16.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let an ordinary breath come and go.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:16.10,0:06:17.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,For these moments,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can leave the unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.67,0:06:21.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,calculation unfinished.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.76,0:06:26.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Take therefore no
Dialogue: 4,0:06:26.01,0:06:28.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,thought for the morrow:
Dialogue: 5,0:06:28.00,0:06:30.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the morrow shall take thought
Dialogue: 5,0:06:30.05,0:06:31.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the things of itself.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.90,0:06:33.86,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Sufficient unto the day
Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.86,0:06:35.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is the evil thereof.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.35,0:06:37.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.86,0:06:41.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the appointment on the calendar.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:41.02,0:06:42.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the questions
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.71,0:06:45.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,I hope to ask and the answers
Dialogue: 4,0:06:45.03,0:06:46.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am afraid to hear.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:46.93,0:06:48.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me bring any notes
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.68,0:06:50.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,or documents I need,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.20,0:06:52.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,and seek appropriate support
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.34,0:06:54.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,if I want someone with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.62,0:06:58.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place the unknown parts before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:58.07,0:07:00.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me courage for the actual
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.24,0:07:01.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,hour when it comes.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:01.91,0:07:04.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the demand to experience
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.72,0:07:08.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,that hour many times before it arrives.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:09.45,0:07:10.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,In a moment,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:10.28,0:07:12.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,we pray for the person whose
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.21,0:07:14.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,trouble you are carrying tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.38,0:07:15.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the person whose
Dialogue: 4,0:07:17.42,0:07:19.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,trouble weighs on me.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.25,0:07:21.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I wish I could know exactly
Dialogue: 4,0:07:21.29,0:07:23.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,what they need and make
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.03,0:07:24.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,their next day easier.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:24.99,0:07:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me listen to what they
Dialogue: 4,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,actually tell me.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.57,0:07:30.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep my concern from becoming
Dialogue: 4,0:07:30.93,0:07:33.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,pressure for them to reassure me.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:33.91,0:07:35.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me a practical
Dialogue: 4,0:07:35.40,0:07:37.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,kindness within my reach.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.66,0:07:39.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,As I leave the rest with you,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.89,0:07:41.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,teach me a love
Dialogue: 4,0:07:41.04,0:07:43.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,that respects their voice,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,their choices,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:44.11,0:07:45.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my own limits.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:46.99,0:07:47.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.55,0:07:49.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:07:49.36,0:07:51.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,that ended awkwardly.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.32,0:07:52.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,There was a look
Dialogue: 4,0:07:52.63,0:07:54.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,I could not read,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.02,0:07:56.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,a sentence I wish I had softened,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.72,0:07:59.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a silence I did not understand.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:59.80,0:08:01.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me resist filling
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.49,0:08:03.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,that silence with accusations
Dialogue: 4,0:08:03.72,0:08:06.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,against myself or someone else.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:06.41,0:08:08.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I owe an apology,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:08.33,0:08:11.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,let it be sincere and specific.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.21,0:08:13.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I need clarification,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.52,0:08:15.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me ask kindly.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.44,0:08:17.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,I surrender the imaginary
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.42,0:08:19.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,versions of that conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.73,0:08:22.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,that cannot give me truth.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:23.30,0:08:23.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,I accept responsibility
Dialogue: 4,0:08:25.40,0:08:27.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the words that were mine.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:27.88,0:08:30.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask your forgiveness where I used
Dialogue: 4,0:08:30.76,0:08:34.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,tiredness as an excuse to be unkind.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:34.03,0:08:37.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me make repair without demanding
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.00,0:08:39.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,immediate reassurance in return.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.88,0:08:42.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,If another person needs time,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:42.04,0:08:44.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me patience with their pace.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:44.80,0:08:45.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:45.44,0:08:48.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,let remorse point toward an honest
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.15,0:08:51.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,action instead of an endless replay.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:51.31,0:08:53.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place the relationship
Dialogue: 4,0:08:53.09,0:08:54.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,in your care while I wait
Dialogue: 4,0:08:54.95,0:08:57.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,for an appropriate moment to speak.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:59.04,0:09:01.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}In the multitude of my thoughts within
Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.94,0:09:04.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}me thy comforts delight my soul.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next comes the voice that judges
Dialogue: 4,0:09:08.55,0:09:10.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,you when the house is quiet.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.93,0:09:13.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,We will bring that to God too.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.18,0:09:14.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.50,0:09:17.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the judgment I keep passing
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.18,0:09:20.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,on myself when everything becomes quiet.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,I hear that I should
Dialogue: 4,0:09:22.07,0:09:23.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,have known more,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:23.20,0:09:24.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,finished more,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:24.20,0:09:26.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,or handled the day better.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:26.34,0:09:28.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me learn from what happened
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.57,0:09:31.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,without treating myself with contempt.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:31.51,0:09:33.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me the difference between
Dialogue: 4,0:09:33.90,0:09:36.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,correction that helps me grow
Dialogue: 4,0:09:36.21,0:09:39.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,and accusation that only wears me down.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.62,0:09:41.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for the humility
Dialogue: 4,0:09:41.39,0:09:42.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be a learner,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:42.68,0:09:44.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,with room to receive
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.29,0:09:46.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,mercy and try again.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.41,0:09:47.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.98,0:09:49.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring my tired body
Dialogue: 4,0:09:49.71,0:09:52.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,into this prayer as well.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.06,0:09:54.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,I notice the tension I carried through
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.99,0:09:57.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,the day and the impatience I sometimes
Dialogue: 4,0:09:57.92,0:10:00.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,feel toward my own limits.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.23,0:10:02.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me respond with care.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.64,0:10:04.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide me toward appropriate
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.78,0:10:06.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,help when I need it,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.36,0:10:07.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,and toward ordinary
Dialogue: 4,0:10:07.86,0:10:10.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,habits that support rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:10.13,0:10:12.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am not asking my body
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.09,0:10:14.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,to prove my faith tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:14.59,0:10:16.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask to treat it as something
Dialogue: 4,0:10:16.83,0:10:19.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,entrusted to me with tenderness.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:20.72,0:10:21.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.13,0:10:23.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,when the same concern returns,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me answer it gently.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.95,0:10:28.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have named it before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:28.47,0:10:30.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have considered whether
Dialogue: 4,0:10:30.40,0:10:32.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,anything requires action now.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.93,0:10:35.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,If there is no new information
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,and no present responsibility,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.59,0:10:40.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me stop reopening the case.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.38,0:10:43.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive my repeated turning toward you.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:43.94,0:10:46.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me a patient trust that can
Dialogue: 4,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,be practiced in small moments,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,without demanding a perfect
Dialogue: 4,0:10:51.14,0:10:53.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,feeling or an uninterrupted
Dialogue: 4,0:10:53.30,0:10:55.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,silence inside my thoughts.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.96,0:10:59.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou wilt keep him in perfect peace,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.81,0:11:02.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}whose mind is stayed on thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:11:02.40,0:11:04.95,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}because he trusteth in thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Faithful God,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.36,0:11:09.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my trust in your character
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.87,0:11:11.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,rather than the strength of
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.86,0:11:13.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,my concentration.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:13.42,0:11:17.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,I know how easily my attention wanders.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:17.00,0:11:19.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me return to what is true
Dialogue: 4,0:11:19.02,0:11:20.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,about you with patience.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:20.93,0:11:23.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from using this prayer as
Dialogue: 4,0:11:23.49,0:11:26.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,another task to perform flawlessly.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:26.50,0:11:28.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to become more
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.10,0:11:29.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,honest in your presence,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.93,0:11:32.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,more willing to receive help,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:32.15,0:11:34.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,and more able to leave an unanswered
Dialogue: 4,0:11:34.89,0:11:37.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,question without following it
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.11,0:11:39.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,through every imagined outcome.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:40.97,0:11:42.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,We are almost
Dialogue: 4,0:11:42.01,0:11:43.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,at the place of rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.98,0:11:44.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:44.46,0:11:46.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,a few words of trust
Dialogue: 4,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,to say with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can be honest about
Dialogue: 4,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,what troubles me.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.62,0:11:53.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can ask for help before
Dialogue: 4,0:11:53.58,0:11:56.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,I reach the end of my strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.30,0:11:58.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can make a plan without
Dialogue: 4,0:11:58.34,0:12:00.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,predicting every result.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:00.61,0:12:03.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can care for another person without
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.49,0:12:06.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,carrying their entire future.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:06.05,0:12:07.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can leave a message
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.75,0:12:09.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,unanswered for a time when
Dialogue: 4,0:12:09.85,0:12:12.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,no urgent need is present.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,God receives the concern
Dialogue: 4,0:12:14.30,0:12:16.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can name and the concern
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.51,0:12:19.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot yet put into words.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.39,0:12:22.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Make this small commitment
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.18,0:12:24.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,before the readings for sleep:
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.55,0:12:26.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,choose one concern that needs
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.78,0:12:28.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,attention tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.25,0:12:30.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,and give it one practical
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.17,0:12:32.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,next step and a time.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,You might decide,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.45,0:12:34.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,“After breakfast,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:34.81,0:12:37.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will call about the bill.”
Dialogue: 4,0:12:37.06,0:12:38.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you need a reminder,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:38.90,0:12:41.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,write only that short line.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:41.37,0:12:43.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then close the note.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.44,0:12:45.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have given your responsibility
Dialogue: 4,0:12:45.78,0:12:47.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,a place in tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:47.16,0:12:49.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,so you can stop trying to keep
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.22,0:12:51.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,it alive by rehearsing it tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.06,0:12:53.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.64,0:12:55.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,I commit this one step
Dialogue: 4,0:12:55.43,0:12:57.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,and its time to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:57.36,0:13:00.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me follow through with the strength
Dialogue: 4,0:13:00.25,0:13:02.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,and information available then.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:02.80,0:13:03.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,For tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:03.79,0:13:06.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will leave the note closed unless
Dialogue: 4,0:13:06.70,0:13:10.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,a genuine need changes the situation.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:10.07,0:13:11.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I want to reopen it
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.86,0:13:13.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,merely to feel certain,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.56,0:13:15.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,remind me of the care
Dialogue: 4,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have already taken.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.98,0:13:19.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bless this modest act of trust,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:19.43,0:13:21.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,and guide me in the quieter
Dialogue: 4,0:13:21.56,0:13:23.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,hours that follow.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:24.48,0:13:26.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you want to affirm this
Dialogue: 4,0:13:26.45,0:13:28.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,prayer in the comments,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:28.19,0:13:29.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,write amen.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.32,0:13:30.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can also leave
Dialogue: 4,0:13:30.58,0:13:32.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,a prayer request there,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:32.19,0:13:34.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,and in our next night prayer we
Dialogue: 4,0:13:34.35,0:13:37.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,will pray over the requests you share.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.30,0:13:38.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now let the Scripture
Dialogue: 4,0:13:38.83,0:13:41.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,readings accompany your rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:42.23,0:13:44.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let your eyes settle
Dialogue: 4,0:13:44.20,0:13:46.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,wherever they are comfortable.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:46.60,0:13:47.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,From here,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:47.31,0:13:48.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,the pace stays gentle,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:48.85,0:13:50.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,with Scripture and short
Dialogue: 4,0:13:50.54,0:13:52.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,prayers for the night.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:52.39,0:13:54.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to keep
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.26,0:13:56.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,a list of the passages.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:56.42,0:13:59.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can receive one sentence and let
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.13,0:14:01.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,the next arrive when it arrives.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,The concern you set down
Dialogue: 4,0:14:03.85,0:14:06.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,has a next step already.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:06.15,0:14:07.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may leave it there
Dialogue: 4,0:14:07.69,0:14:08.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,while you listen,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,without checking the time
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.62,0:14:12.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,or measuring your progress.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:14.31,0:14:16.09,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}When thou liest down,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.09,0:14:18.51,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou shalt not be afraid:
Dialogue: 5,0:14:18.51,0:14:20.36,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}yea, thou shalt lie down,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.36,0:14:22.85,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and thy sleep shall be sweet.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.30,0:14:24.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.72,0:14:27.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive this ordinary place
Dialogue: 4,0:14:27.14,0:14:29.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,of rest with gratitude.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:29.36,0:14:30.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me stop treating
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.90,0:14:32.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,the bedside as a desk where
Dialogue: 4,0:14:32.87,0:14:35.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,every problem must be solved.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.29,0:14:37.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the blanket be a blanket
Dialogue: 4,0:14:37.34,0:14:39.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the pillow a pillow.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:39.39,0:14:40.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I leave the manner
Dialogue: 4,0:14:42.38,0:14:45.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,and timing outside my command.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:45.11,0:14:47.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me patience with this
Dialogue: 4,0:14:47.18,0:14:49.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,night as it unfolds.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:49.08,0:14:51.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,May I meet my own weariness
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.19,0:14:53.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the kindness I would
Dialogue: 4,0:14:53.14,0:14:55.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,offer someone dear to me.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.89,0:14:57.70,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}It is vain
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.70,0:14:59.71,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for you to rise up early,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.71,0:15:00.91,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to sit up late,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.91,0:15:03.46,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to eat the bread of sorrows:
Dialogue: 5,0:15:03.46,0:15:06.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for so he giveth his beloved sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.04,0:15:10.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let the last sentence
Dialogue: 4,0:15:10.27,0:15:12.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,fade without replacing it.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:12.56,0:15:14.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice the support beneath
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.59,0:15:16.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,your head or back.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:16.30,0:15:19.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is no special rhythm to achieve.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.44,0:15:20.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may be quiet
Dialogue: 4,0:15:20.66,0:15:22.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,for a little while,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:22.10,0:15:23.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,with nothing to explain
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.86,0:15:26.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,and no new concern to name.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.22,0:15:30.95,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve
Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.95,0:15:32.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thee from all evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.68,0:15:35.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he shall preserve thy soul.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.89,0:15:38.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve thy
Dialogue: 5,0:15:38.81,0:15:40.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}going out and thy coming
Dialogue: 5,0:15:40.52,0:15:42.23,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in from this time forth,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.23,0:15:44.15,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and even for evermore.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.60,0:15:46.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:46.12,0:15:48.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place this evening before
Dialogue: 4,0:15:48.15,0:15:50.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,you just as it has been.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:50.25,0:15:52.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for hearing each
Dialogue: 4,0:15:52.19,0:15:54.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,concern separately and receiving
Dialogue: 4,0:15:54.58,0:15:57.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,the words I struggled to find.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.12,0:15:59.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me carry the practical commitment
Dialogue: 4,0:15:59.84,0:16:02.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,into tomorrow when its time comes.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.56,0:16:03.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Until then,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:03.53,0:16:06.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for a gentle heart toward
Dialogue: 4,0:16:06.25,0:16:08.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,myself and those around me.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:08.92,0:16:11.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your care remain the thought
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.46,0:16:14.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside my unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:14.22,0:16:17.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,I leave the conversation here for now,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:17.05,0:16:19.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,held within your enduring love.
